      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hendrum%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A Great Northern Railroad line was built along the Red River in 1883, bringing freight and travelers through Hendrum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://norman.mngenweb.net/Towns/hendrum.htm",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In spring 1897, floodwaters from the Wild Rice River surged west to the Red River, inundating Hendrum.",
